# Android conventions

Jetpack Compose and Material 3, using the generated `{{THEME_NAME}}Theme.kt` ([../../../assets/platforms/mobile/android/](../../../assets/platforms/mobile/android/)).
Shared mobile rules: [../README.md](../README.md).

- **Navigation:** `NavigationBar` for top-level places, Navigation Compose for depth, bottom sheets for focused tasks;
  predictive back works on every screen.
- **Controls:** Material 3 components styled with the theme, never custom replacements for buttons, text fields, switches,
  menus or dialogs.
- **Colours, type, spacing, shapes, motion:** only the generated theme values; no `Color(0x...)` or fixed `sp` sizes in screens.
- **Icons:** Material Symbols, by the names in `assets/icons/icon-map.json`.
- **Font scale:** every text style scales; layouts reflow at 200%.
- **TalkBack:** `contentDescription` on icon-only controls; semantics for roles and state; logical focus order.
- **Dark mode:** follows the system setting; the theme switches by itself. Dynamic colour is off unless the owner decides otherwise.
- **Edge to edge:** handle window insets; content respects system bars and the keyboard.
